# grub-tools runtime edges, one per proven linkage (readelf over every
# moved binary; the base pin is added automatically by the splitter):
# fuse3: grub-mount links libfuse3 (monolith package today; a fuse3-libs
#   follow-up would narrow this, like lvm2-libs did for libdevmapper).
# lvm2-libs: the moved tools link libdevmapper (global -ldevmapper flag).
# xz: mknetdir/mkrescue/mkstandalone/editenv link liblzma (monolith
#   today; xz-libs follow-up, same pattern).
# libtasn1: grub-protect links it (drops with protect if that fork goes).
fuse3
lvm2-libs
xz
libtasn1
